{"section":{"id":"cet4-2025-06-set1-news-report-1","examId":"cet4-2025-06-set1","title":"新闻 1","kind":"新闻","start":43.15,"end":116.51,"preview":"Everything changed for seven-year-old Tariq when he slapped some butter on an ear of corn.","lines":[{"start":43.15,"end":49.23,"text":"Everything changed for seven-year-old Tariq when he slapped some butter on an ear of corn."},{"start":49.23,"end":53.79,"text":"He knew it tasted good, but butter made it better."},{"start":53.79,"end":61.39,"text":"His passion for produce got him a position as South Dakota's official corn ambassador."},{"start":61.39,"end":68.35,"text":"Tariq's profession of love for his favorite vegetable earned him the name The Corn Kid."},{"start":68.35,"end":75.71,"text":"This was after his online interview attracted millions of views and was made into a song."},{"start":75.71,"end":80.43,"text":"South Dakota is one of the top corn producers in America."},{"start":80.43,"end":84.43,"text":"The corn provides nourishment across the globe."},{"start":84.43,"end":93.47,"text":"Tariq said not everyone has to like corn, but everyone should definitely try it, especially with butter."},{"start":93.47,"end":102.19,"text":"Tariq and his family were invited to South Dakota to attend the honorary ceremony at the state's Corn Palace."},{"start":102.19,"end":110.11,"text":"Officials wanted to highlight South Dakota's two largest industries, tourism and agriculture."},{"start":110.11,"end":116.51,"text":"Tariq couldn't believe his eyes when he saw the palace made of corn."}],"audio":"assets/audio/457043579ea07f318a18731330ffae5f223c5fd9f01a557798b8dd703c59af0f.wav","audioOffset":43.15},"tasks":[{"id":"0-0","text":"Everything changed for seven-year-old Tariq when he slapped some butter on an ear of corn.","start":43.15,"end":49.23,"legacyTaskIds":["0-0"],"legacyTaskIndices":[0],"sentenceVisual":{"type":"时间","icon":"clock-3","image":"assets/images/10ad1fa05efb5396a1846c4617f5cb2d6f34ab9f8d6f6ae1339d1e6dd1373ce7.webp","